#6603
Path to the Mountain~
   You are on a small, nondescript path leading north toward a mountain
whose peak is lost in brooding clouds.  The closer you get, the worse
you feel about the whole thing, and you begin to remember old stories of
a hidden mountain that was, for some unknown reason, named DragonSpyre.
A rocky slope lies to the west.
~
