#6604
Path to the Mountain~
   You are on a small, nondescript path leading north toward the
mountain.  The deep stench of dragon wafts through the air now,
sulfurous and rank, and you feel the first tinges of dragon fear
stirring within you.  The trees here are scorched and stunted.  Maybe
you should go back while you still have the option.
~
