#6605
At the foot of the Mountain~
   You have reached the foot of the great mountain.  The dragon stench
here is almost strong enough to overwhelm you, and you can only bear it
by tearing off a piece of cloth and tying it over your mouth and nose.
Charred bones lie among the rocks.  Far above you, you can see what must
be the entrance to the cave.  The path leads back south.
~
