#6606
Climbing the Mountain~
   Now that you have something to concentrate on, the climb, you are
able to think more clearly.  You have faced dragons before, and
vanquished them; why should these be any different?  The thought keeps
rolling through your mind, but as you haul yourself up onto the next
level of the cliff, it does little to ease your fear.
~
