#6607
Climbing the Mountain~
   You are close enough to the entrance now to hear the sounds from
within.  The first thing you notice is that the mountain itself seems to
breathe: in and out goes its breath, constantly, a warm, foul wind.
Suddenly you hear footsteps approaching from all around you and brace
for combat, until you realize that the sound was your own heart
pounding.
~
