#6608
The ledge on the Mountain~
   You have reached a small ledge about a quarter of the way up the
mountain.  To the east is the entrance to what seems to be a small cave,
but the screams echoing from within it, which seem to go on forever,
hint that it is far larger than it looks.  The climb leads back down.
~
