#6609
Entrance to the Cave~
   Once inside the cave you feel completely cut off from the outside
world.  Horrific sounds of death and fear echo all around you.  The
walls are stained in many shades of red and brown, and frost glitters
strangely on one of them.  Even through the cloth, the smell of dragon
is almost unbearable.  The tunnel leads east, and the ledge lies west.
~
