#6610
Walking through DragonSpyre~
   Within the realm of DragonSpyre everything feels wrong.  The walls
seem to lean toward you, and the floor and ceiling seem to strain to
crush the life from you.  The rock is scorched black in places and
gouged by enormous claws, and the further you go into the mountain, the
more you wish you had never come.  The tunnel leads east and west.
~
