#6632
The Lair of the White Dragon~
   You have found, through luck or otherwise, the lair of the white
dragon.  Every wall is coated with a thick layer of blue-white ice, and
icicles as long as spears hang from the ceiling.  The floor is so slick
that you slip several times before you find your footing.  Frozen
shapes, perhaps past adventurers, are locked within the ice.  Will you
fight, or flee?  "It is JUST a dragon."  Passages lead east and south.
~
