#6650
Treasure Room~
   All around you the hoard of the white dragon glimmers.  It has
plainly been collecting for a very long time: there are little bits of
everything here, from broken swords to the leg bone of a dracolich, all
frozen together in heaps of ice.  What catches your eye most is the
great pile of gold covering the floor.  A door leads west.
~
