#6651
Walking through DragonSpyre~
   You have made it past the white dragon, the first of your challenges,
and now you are entitled to its treasure... if you can find it.  This
hallway is colder than the rest of the cave, and your breath steams in
the air; frost feathers the walls, and the white dragon must have passed
this way often to make sure its gold was still safe.  You begin to hope
that it wasn't a baby...  A few white scales lie scattered on the frozen
floor.  The hallway leads east and west.
~
