#6656
Walking through DragonSpyre~
   This hallway is a radical change from the last.  The walls are rough
and unworked, as if the mountain had only just been hollowed out, and
the air feels thick and heavy.  It feels as though time itself were
slowing down: each step takes an age, and the hallway looks as if it
might go on for all eternity... though at the sluggish pace you are
moving, eternity might not be that far.  The hallway leads north and
south.
~
