#6673
Lair of the Copper Dragon~
   Within the bounds of this room, time seems to have stopped
altogether.  Nothing moves except a great mass at the back of the room.
Out of the corner of your eye you catch a glimpse of a droplet of water
"falling" from a stalactite... it appears to have hung in the same place
for the past century.  Copper-green scales glint in the gloom.  The way
out lies west.
~
