#6690
Pixie King's Bedroom~
   You have entered the private quarters of the Pixie King.  A bed no
larger than a loaf of bread stands beneath a canopy of butterfly wings,
and tiny chests and wardrobes line the walls, their drawers hanging
open.  You can just imagine a horde of guards walking in on you, though
luckily they never do.  Even so, you had better make your stay here a
short one.  A door leads east.
~
