#6694
Throne room of the Pixie King~
   The throne room is remarkably well kept, considering the anarchy of
the pixie hierarchy, and the power of the time dragon does not seem to
touch it at all; here everything moves at its proper pace.  Garlands of
flowers hang from the walls, and a humongous throne, far too large for
any pixie, stands at the far end of the room.  A door leads west.
~
